    {
      "number": 8,
      "title": "FIX: proper handling of group memberships",
      "issue_comments": [{"body":"**Droid finished @varin-nair-factory's task** —— [View job](https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/actions/runs/21495360895)\n\n---","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:42:07Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/8#issuecomment-3820540829","id":3820540829}],
      "review_comments": [{"body":"[P1] Incorrect totalPages calculation causes off-by-one pagination\n\n`totalPages` is computed as `Math.floor(user_count / limit) + 1`, which over-counts when `user_count` is an exact multiple of `limit` (e.g. 50 users with limit=50 yields 2 pages). This will surface as a phantom last page and incorrect `showingLast` behavior. Use `Math.ceil(user_count / limit)` (keeping the `user_count == 0` guard) to compute the correct page count.","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:53:05Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/8#discussion_r2743712475","id":2743712475,"line":13,"path":"app/assets/javascripts/admin/controllers/admin-group.js.es6","side":"RIGHT"}],
      "reviews": [{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3657874129","id":3657874129,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-13T20:44:17Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3672454997","id":3672454997,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-16T19:43:54Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3693875306","id":3693875306,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T18:14:30Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3694163801","id":3694163801,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T19:21:51Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3707998707","id":3707998707,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-26T21:06:55Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3712980507","id":3712980507,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T19:06:51Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3714027997","id":3714027997,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T00:12:35Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3718585781","id":3718585781,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T19:10:38Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3725244937","id":3725244937,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:53:05Z"},{"body":"One concrete functional issue: the admin group pagination `totalPages` computation is off-by-one when `user_count` is an exact multiple of `limit`, leading to phantom pages and incorrect last-page state. Other flagged items were not provable bugs from the diff.","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/8#pullrequestreview-3725245319","id":3725245319,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:53:12Z"}]
    }    ,
    {
      "number": 9,
      "title": "FEATURE: Localization fallbacks (server-side)",
      "issue_comments": [{"body":"**Droid finished @varin-nair-factory's task** —— [View job](https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/actions/runs/21495362636)\n\n---","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:42:56Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/9#issuecomment-3820547039","id":3820547039}],
      "review_comments": [{"body":"[P1] Potential boot-time NoMethodError when default_locale is nil\n\n`SiteSetting.default_locale.to_sym` will raise if `default_locale` is `nil` (e.g., early boot before settings are available or misconfiguration). The later `.compact` does not help because the exception happens first. Use `SiteSetting.default_locale\u0026.to_sym` (or otherwise guard for nil) so fallbacks still work safely in all initialization contexts.","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:51:07Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/9#discussion_r2743705468","id":2743705468,"line":17,"path":"config/initializers/i18n.rb","side":"RIGHT"}],
      "reviews": [{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3657874526","id":3657874526,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-13T20:44:24Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3672454001","id":3672454001,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-16T19:43:36Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3693862639","id":3693862639,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T18:11:38Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3694140523","id":3694140523,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T19:18:35Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3708022134","id":3708022134,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-26T21:12:16Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3712989910","id":3712989910,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T19:08:44Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3714023818","id":3714023818,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T00:10:28Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3718608288","id":3718608288,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T19:14:04Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3725236555","id":3725236555,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:51:07Z"},{"body":"Overall the fallback wiring looks reasonable, but `FallbackLocaleList#[]` can still crash if `SiteSetting.default_locale` is nil (e.g., via a global override/misconfig), so it should be guarded to avoid taking down boot/request paths.","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/9#pullrequestreview-3725236736","id":3725236736,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T21:51:09Z"}]
    }    ,
    {
      "number": 10,
      "title": "FEATURE: Can edit category/host relationships for embedding",
      "issue_comments": [{"body":"**Droid finished @varin-nair-factory's task** —— [View job](https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/actions/runs/21495364338)\n\n---","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:42:59Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#issuecomment-3820547436","id":3820547436}],
      "review_comments": [{"body":"[P0] update/destroy can 500 on missing record\n\nBoth `update` and `destroy` do `EmbeddableHost.where(id: params[:id]).first` and then call methods on the result without a nil check. If the id is invalid, this raises `NoMethodError` and returns a 500 to any staff user. Return a 404/JSON error when the record is not found.","created_at":"2026-01-29T22:12:44Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#discussion_r2743768048","id":2743768048,"line":18,"path":"app/controllers/admin/embeddable_hosts_controller.rb","side":"RIGHT"},{"body":"[P1] before_validation can crash when host is nil\n\nThe `before_validation` block calls `self.host.sub!` unconditionally. If `host` is nil (e.g., bad params, console usage), this raises `NoMethodError`. Guard with `return if host.blank?` (or `if self.host`) before calling `sub!`.","created_at":"2026-01-29T22:12:44Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#discussion_r2743768053","id":2743768053,"line":6,"path":"app/models/embeddable_host.rb","side":"RIGHT"},{"body":"[P1] Delete action drops errors silently\n\n`destroyRecord().then(...)` in the `delete()` action has no `.catch(...)`, so failures (403/500/network) won’t surface to the user and the row may remain in a confusing state. Since `popupAjaxError` is already imported, add `.catch(popupAjaxError)`.","created_at":"2026-01-29T22:12:44Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#discussion_r2743768054","id":2743768054,"line":47,"path":"app/assets/javascripts/admin/components/embeddable-host.js.es6","side":"RIGHT"},{"body":"[P0] Migration SQL injection via unescaped host values\n\nThe migration interpolates `h` directly into an `execute` string: `VALUES ('#{h}', ...)`. If the existing `embeddable_hosts` site setting contains a quote or malicious SQL, this can execute arbitrary SQL during migration. Use `connection.quote(h)` or parameterized inserts instead of string interpolation.","created_at":"2026-01-29T22:12:44Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#discussion_r2743768056","id":2743768056,"line":23,"path":"db/migrate/20150818190757_create_embeddable_hosts.rb","side":"RIGHT"},{"body":"[P1] Migration can raise when embed_category lookup returns no rows\n\n`execute(...)[0]['id']` assumes the query always returns at least one row. If `embed_category` is unset or doesn’t match any category name, `execute(...)[0]` is nil and the migration will crash with a NoMethodError. Guard for empty results before indexing.","created_at":"2026-01-29T22:12:44Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#discussion_r2743768059","id":2743768059,"line":7,"path":"db/migrate/20150818190757_create_embeddable_hosts.rb","side":"RIGHT"}],
      "reviews": [{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3657877314","id":3657877314,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-13T20:45:20Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3672461721","id":3672461721,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-16T19:45:46Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3693879971","id":3693879971,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T18:15:53Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3694163085","id":3694163085,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T19:21:44Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3708006633","id":3708006633,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-26T21:08:35Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3712984272","id":3712984272,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-27T19:07:31Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3714028397","id":3714028397,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T00:12:49Z"},{"body":".","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3718593793","id":3718593793,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-28T19:11:46Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3725309375","id":3725309375,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T22:12:43Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3725309378","id":3725309378,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T22:12:44Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3725309379","id":3725309379,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T22:12:44Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3725309382","id":3725309382,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T22:12:44Z"},{"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3725309384","id":3725309384,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T22:12:44Z"},{"body":"I left inline comments on a few concrete issues: the embeddable-host migration interpolates host values into raw SQL (and can also crash when `embed_category` has no match), the admin controller’s update/destroy paths can 500 on missing records, and the EmbeddableHost model’s `before_validation` can raise when `host` is nil. There’s also a missing error handler on the admin UI delete action that will silently drop failures.","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-discourse/pull/10#pullrequestreview-3725309648","id":3725309648,"state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-01-29T22:12:50Z"}]
    }
  ]
